setAccountingCurrency.t.sol
├── when caller is not the module's safe
│  └── it should revert with UnauthorizedCaller
└── when caller is the module's safe
   ├── given the provided currency is not the default currency and price data is not registered for it
   │  └── it should revert with PriceFeedRouteNotRegistered
   └── given the provided currency is the default currency or price data is registered for it
      ├── it should update the accounting currency in the contract storage
      └── it should emit an AccountingCurrencyChanged event
